  "notes": "Cash basis county audit, FYE 6/30/2022. Governmental lines from Exhibit D (p4) Total Governmental Funds column. Exhibit D rolls forward fund balances (767,416 + 1,044,674 - 914,644 + 12,105 - 12,105 = 897,446), recorded in the fund_balance fields; ending_cash is the printed Equity in Pooled Cash 897,446 (p3); beginning cash is not printed (null). Transfers in/out 12,105 are the Total-column figures (Road Fund to Highway Allocation Bond debt service fund). No business-type funds. General Fund 'Taxes' and 'Local' split by the General column of Exhibit D (exact ties; parent budgets Taxes 331,376 / Local 34,400 not put on pieces); Road 'Taxes' is property tax per Exhibit D and the Statement of Activities; Road 'Local' is printed in Exhibit D as Charges for Services; Road 'State' kept as other state aid (no highway allocation label printed). Nonmajor special revenue funds recorded per fund from Schedule 3 (p10; Veteran's Aid has no activity); Schedule 4 budget totals used as budget_final only where a fund has a single line. Highway Allocation Bond debt service fund from Schedule 2 (p9). General Fund 'Jail' line has a budget but no actual (not recorded). Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet (p3) Total column, equal to the Statement of Net Position (p1). Read pages 1-12 of 12"
